## Time Required For Processing
A warning to all users hoping to recreate results on a single GPU. This project was completed using a Nvidia GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU, 32Gb of RAM and a 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13905H, on Ubuntu.

